  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate Children on Buyiga Island, Uganda, Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project shall facilitate better learning at Buyiga Secondary School, Buyiga Island, Uganda, by building a brick and cement classroom block with a well-polished concrete floor and a library section, at the school. The library shall be furnished with textbooks, novels and manuals. The project shall also involve construction of 8 pit latrines to improve the sanitation and hygiene at the school. The project shall climax with putting up of 2 water tanks, with one put at the latrines and another</narrative>
  </description>
